@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 42
title SQ — measurable quality scenario contract
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Source + stimulus\nExact intended operation / quality question" as Stimulus
rectangle "Defined environment + artifact\nCandidate / workload / dataset / client / dependencies" as Environment
rectangle "Expected response + measurement\nActual usable result / start-end / units / method" as Measure
rectangle "Agreed criterion + actual later evidence\nCompare result and record limits; unavailable is not Pass" as Evidence #DFF1EA
Stimulus --> Environment
Environment --> Measure
Measure --> Evidence
note bottom of Evidence
No latency, availability, quota, RPO/RTO or workload value invented.
A fast failure is not successful response performance.
Scenario structure is not a benchmark or conformance result.
end note

legend bottom
Logical analysis / evidence boundaries, not installed controls or selected architecture.
No security, load, provider, backup, restore or live-change operation performed.
endlegend
@enduml
